# Lock file excluded — CF Workers Builds / Railway use npm ci on lock
# which fails when the lock was generated on a different platform
# (missing optional cross-platform binaries like @rollup/rollup-linux-*).
# Without lock, builders use `npm install` which resolves fresh per platform.
package-lock.json

